evidence.notes:
The fix is either:
1. Append File.separator: baseDir.getCanonicalPath() + File.separator
2. Use java.nio.file.Path.startsWith() which is component-aware
3. Append separator only if the canonical path doesn't already end with one:
   String canonBase = baseDir.getCanonicalPath();
   if (!canonBase.endsWith(File.separator)) canonBase += File.separator;
   return !file.getCanonicalPath().startsWith(canonBase);

